      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # EUR amount covered by the forward contract\n    eur_amount = 200_000 * 90\n\n    # A long EUR share position is hedged by selling EUR forward.\n    initial_forward_bid = 1.3935 - 19.0 / 10_000\n    three_month_forward_bid = 1.4106 - 21.6 / 10_000\n\n    # Discount the cost of closing the remaining three-month forward.\n    usd_libor = 1.266 / 100\n    time_to_maturity = 3 / 12\n    undiscounted_cost = eur_amount * (three_month_forward_bid - initial_forward_bid)\n    termination_cost = undiscounted_cost / (1 + usd_libor * time_to_maturity)\n\n    return round(termination_cost, 1)\n```",
